@startuml
title Admin User - Get User List (GET /api/admin/users)
hide footbox
actor Client
participant UserController
participant AppUserService
participant UserSpecifications
participant AppUserRepository

Client -> UserController: GET /api/admin/users?keyword=..&role=..&status=..&page=..&size=..
note right of Client: Already authenticated by JwtAuthenticationFilter\nSecurityConfig: /api/admin/** requires role ADMIN

UserController -> AppUserService: getUsers(keyword, role, status, pageable)
AppUserService -> UserSpecifications: search(keyword, role, status)
UserSpecifications -> UserSpecifications: predicate = conjunction() (no filtering)
opt keyword != null AND !keyword.isBlank()
    UserSpecifications -> UserSpecifications: predicate AND (lower(username) LIKE %keyword% OR lower(email) LIKE %keyword%)
end
opt role != null
    UserSpecifications -> UserSpecifications: predicate AND role == role
end
opt status != null
    UserSpecifications -> UserSpecifications: predicate AND status == status
end
UserSpecifications --> AppUserService: Specification<AppUser>
AppUserService -> AppUserRepository: findAll(specification, pageable)
AppUserRepository --> AppUserService: Page<AppUser>
AppUserService -> AppUserService: page.map(UserResponse::from)
AppUserService --> UserController: Page<UserResponse>
UserController --> Client: 200 OK (Page<UserResponse>)
@enduml